<%#
  Infinite-scroll sentinel for the album's photo grid.

  Its own partial with its own turbo_stream target: adding or removing a photo
  can change the number of pages, and a sentinel left behind by the previous
  render would point at a page that no longer exists.

  Locals: album, page, total_pages
%>
<%= render "shared/infinite_scroll",
           page: page,
           total_pages: total_pages,
           container: "#album_photo_grid",
           path_for_page: ->(n) { album_path(album, album_view_params(page: n)) } %>
